+ * Gated on CONFIG_LIBPLACEBO_FILTER: the same guard vf_libplacebo uses, on
+ * when libplacebo + Vulkan SDK are present at configure time. The scaleplex
+ * deps image is built with --enable-libplacebo --enable-vulkan since the 0094
